    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Boyne is a beautifully designed 4-bedroom end of terrace family home extending to approximately 143 sq.m, located within the prestigious new development at The Glen by Park Developments in Cabinteely, Dublin 18.\r\n\r\nThis spacious A-rated home has been thoughtfully designed to provide bright, well-proportioned accommodation ideal for modern family living. Benefiting from its end of terrace position, the property enjoys additional natural light throughout. The ground floor features a generous living room to the front and a large open-plan kitchen/dining area to the rear, creating an excellent space for both everyday living and entertaining. Double doors open onto the private rear garden, further enhancing the sense of space and light.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers four well-appointed bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with en-suite, along with a contemporary family bathroom. Each home is finished to a high standard, with a strong focus on quality materials, attention to detail, and energy-efficient design throughout.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned, The Glen is just a short distance from the heart of Cabinteely village, offering a range of local shops, cafés, and amenities. Larger shopping destinations such as Cornelscourt Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre are easily accessible, while nearby coastal areas including Killiney and Dún Laoghaire provide a wealth of leisure options.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by excellent transport links, including the N11 and M50 road networks, frequent Dublin Bus services, and the LUAS Green Line at Carrickmines, ensuring convenient access to Dublin city centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nThe Boyne offers an ideal opportunity to acquire a spacious, energy-efficient family home in one of South Dublin’s most sought-after locations."
      },
